cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the accompanying paper and identify the software commit when referring to this formalization."
type: software
title: "The Zygmund and Rey conjectures in Lean"
authors:
  - family-names: Martikainen
    given-names: Henri
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: "Lean 4 formalization of proofs of the Zygmund conjecture and Rey’s exponential integrability conjecture, together with the underlying weakly incomparable maximal estimate and related dyadic, overlap and sharpness results. Includes an independent specification rebuilt from Mathlib primitives and instructions for reproducing verification with Lean, Comparator, Nanoda and con-ron."
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "The Zygmund conjecture and Rey's exponential integrability conjecture"
  authors:
